message: "If you use NeuroLjus or refer to this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "NeuroLjus: Empathic, Privacy-First Technology for Sensory Understanding and Caregiver Support"
abstract: >-
  NeuroLjus is an independent social-innovation initiative and experimental,
  privacy-first platform supporting autistic individuals, their families, and
  caregivers. It pairs on-device movement-signal sensing (NL-VISION, MediaPipe
  Holistic, processed entirely in the browser) with an optional, non-diagnostic
  multilingual AI assistant (Care Chat), and is designed to grow into a
  connected ecosystem for care discovery, community, and learning. The system
  is explicitly non-diagnostic, GDPR-aligned, and architected so that users
  retain ownership and control of their data.
